2. The following offences may be compounded by the Director‑General in accordance with section 25 of the Act:
(a)any offence under section 4(1), 5(4), 8(4), 13(3), 15D(4), 16(b) or 17(1) or (2) of the Act;
(b)any offence under section 19 of the Act, where the offence referred to in that section as being abetted or attempted is a compoundable offence under paragraph (a).
